'''Tyrantrum''' (Japanese: '''ガチゴラス''' ''Gachigoras'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

